<title>SINGAPORE: CAM Mechatronics seeks share suspension.</title>
<headline>CAM Mechatronics seeks share suspension.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1996-09-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Precision engineering company CAM Mechatronic Ltd said on Friday it has requested a suspension in trading of its shares on September 16 pending an announcement.</p>
<p>No further details were given.</p>
<p>-- Singapore newsroom (65 8703080)</p>
